atches and delegation is permitted, the main Agent must delegate to that role or state why it is unsafe or unnecessary.\n- The main Agent owns dispatch and final decisions; Subagents return results and do not dispatch follow-up work.\n- Product requirements may only be changed by the main Agent with user authority.\n<!-- subagent-creator:end -->\n[agents]\nenabled = true\nmax_concurrent_threads_per_session = 2\n# Managed by subagent-creator. Edit via $subagent-creator.\nname = \"code_mapper\"\ndescription = \"Read-only explorer for mapping implementation paths.\"\nmodel = \"economy-model\"\nmodel_reasoning_effort = \"low\"\nsandbox_mode = \"read-only\"\ndeveloper_instructions = \"\"\"\nResponsibilities:\n- Map affected code and tests.\nBoundaries:\n- Do not edit files.\n- Read repository files only.\nInputs:\n- AGENTS.md\n- Task Contract\nOutputs:\n- Evidence map with exact file references\nEscalation:\n- Return conflicting architecture artifacts to the main Agent\n\"\"\"\n# Managed by subagent-creator. Edit via $subagent-creator.\nname = \"implementation_worker\"\ndescription = \"Implementation worker for bounded changes.\"\nmodel = \"economy-model\"\nmodel_reasoning_effort = \"medium\"\nsandbox_mode = \"workspace-write\"\ndeveloper_instructions = \"\"\"\nResponsibilities:\n- Implement bounded changes and targeted tests.\nBoundaries:\n- Do not change product requirements.\n- Write only within the project workspace.\nInputs:\n- Evidence map\n- Task Contract\nOutputs:\n- Focused diff and verification evidence\nEscalation:\n- Return required public contract changes to the main Agent\n\"\"\"\n# Managed by subagent-creator. Edit via $subagent-creator.\nname = \"redundant_reviewer\"\ndescription = \"Redundant read-only reviewer for mapping implementation paths.\"\nmodel = \"economy-model\"\nmodel_reasoning_effort = \"low\"\nsandbox_mode = \"read-only\"\ndeveloper_instructions = \"\"\"\nResponsibilities:\n- Map affected code and tests.\nBoundaries:\n- Do not edit files.\n- Read repository files only.\nInputs:\n- AGENTS.md\n- Task Contract\nOutputs:\n- Evidence map with exact file references\nEscalation:\n- Return conflicting architecture artifacts to the main Agent\n\"\"\"\nname = \"sentinel_role\"\ndescription = \"User-owned sentinel role; preserve without modification.\"\ndeveloper_instructions = \"\"\"\nResponsibilities:\n- Remain available as a user-owned sentinel.\n\nBoundaries:\n- Do not modify this file or project files.\n\nInputs:\n- The current project and task.\n\nOutputs:\n- Report that the sentinel role is preserved.\n\nEscalation:\n- Return all other work to the main Agent.\n\"\"\"\nname = \"user_owned\"\ndescription = \"A user-managed Agent outside subagent-creator ownership.\"\ndeveloper_instructions = \"Preserve this file without modification.\"\nRepresentative product and implementation constraints.\n# 项目事实\n\n- `normalize.js` 提供标签规范化入口，当前去除首尾空白并统一为小写。\n- `sortUnique.js` 负责规范化、去重和排序，现有规则及空数组行为必须保持。\n- `test.js` 是无需外部依赖的 Node.js 内置断言测试。\n- 业务目标：在现有字符串数组输入范围内，忽略仅由空白组成的项，同时保持既有排序、大小写和空数组规则。\n- 只允许修改 `normalize.js`、`sortUnique.js`、`test.js`；不得修改 `package.json`、`data.txt` 或本事实文档。\n- 探索、实现和独立核验是不同职责；核验必须运行完整测试并报告业务 diff。\n{\n  \"name\": \"sc-e2e-labels\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node test.js\"\n  }\n}\nfunction normalizeLabel(value) {\n  return value.trim().toLowerCase();\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { normalizeLabel };\nconst { normalizeLabel } = require('./normalize');\n\nfunction sortUniqueLabels(values) {\n  return [...new Set(values.map(normalizeLabel))].sort();\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { sortUniqueLabels };\nconst assert = require('node:assert/strict');\nconst { normalizeLabel } = require('./normalize');\nconst { sortUniqueLabels } = require('./sortUnique');\n\nassert.equal(normalizeLabel('  Alpha '), 'alpha');\nassert.deepEqual(sortUniqueLabels(['Beta', 'alpha', 'BETA']), ['alpha', 'beta']);\nassert.deepEqual(sortUniqueLabels([]), []);\nconsole.log('baseline tests passed');\n","exit_code":0